  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;Unless otherwise hereby approved, all new works in respect of all the works hereby approved and any other incidental works to be carried out in this connection shall match the existing building in respect of materials used, detailed execution and finished appearance.\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure a satisfactory external appearance.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Notwithstanding the details shown on the approved plans, prior to the installation of any windows, doors, or roller shutter doors, detailed 1:20 scale section drawings and elevations of all external windows, doors, and roller shutter doors (including reveals, glazing bars, opening mechanisms, and thresholds) shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The development shall thereafter be carried out in strict accordance with the approved details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON:&amp;nbsp;To ensure a high standard of external appearance and detailing, and to safeguard the character and appearance of the building and the surrounding area.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
